WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.043
This is Centaur.

2
00:00:02.567 --> 00:00:05.927
Tomorrow, Cody has a demonstration with Northfield Logistics.

3
00:00:06.889 --> 00:00:08.905
Let's see how Centaur's Briefer gets him ready.

4
00:00:10.163 --> 00:00:13.355
The day before every meeting, the Briefer writes a brief for it.

5
00:00:14.322 --> 00:00:15.643
Cody doesn't have to ask.

6
00:00:15.987 --> 00:00:18.346
It starts with the company.

7
00:00:18.708 --> 00:00:21.144
Who they are, how big, what industry, who owns them.

8
00:00:21.782 --> 00:00:24.990
It looks that up on the web once, and keeps it on the account,

9
00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:27.785
so it isn't paying to research the same company twice.

10
00:00:29.014 --> 00:00:32.213
Everything else comes from what Centaur already knows about the deal.

11
00:00:33.031 --> 00:00:35.885
The challenges Northfield want to solve, in their own words.

12
00:00:36.663 --> 00:00:39.420
What they use today, and who else they're looking at,

13
00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:41.346
which here is Salesforce and HubSpot.

14
00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:46.013
The qualification so far: what's known, and what's still missing.

15
00:00:46.922 --> 00:00:48.288
The risks already flagged.

16
00:00:48.919 --> 00:00:50.826
And a recommended talk track for the call.

17
00:00:52.220 --> 00:00:54.340
The brief is saved as a note on the deal.

18
00:00:55.128 --> 00:00:59.403
It's on Cody's Today page in the morning, and in his daily Slack summary, too.

19
00:01:00.596 --> 00:01:03.525
So, ten minutes before the call, Cody knows that Priya signs off,

20
00:01:03.525 --> 00:01:06.769
that the budget's around forty thousand, that HubSpot is in the running,

21
00:01:06.769 --> 00:01:08.707
and that timing is still the open question.

22
00:01:09.082 --> 00:01:11.116
He walks in ready to ask it.

23
00:01:12.099 --> 00:01:13.653
No digging through emails.

24
00:01:14.771 --> 00:01:17.694
No scrambling for notes.

25
00:01:18.505 --> 00:01:21.315
Just a clear page for every meeting, every day.

26
00:01:22.227 --> 00:01:23.428
Centaur CRM.

27
00:01:24.077 --> 00:01:25.781
Walk into every call prepared.

28
00:01:26.513 --> 00:01:30.057
Book a demonstration today, at centaurcrm.com.

